			}
		]
		gametext: Bearer must be a [dwarven] companion.<br>Bearer is strength +1 for each [dwarven] possession and [dwarven] artifact in your discard pile (limit +3).<br><b>Maneuver:</b> Take a [dwarven] event into hand from your discard pile. Discard this artifact.
